<title>UK: Safeway up amid positive comment on results.</title>
<headline>Safeway up amid positive comment on results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Safeway Plc touched a 3-1/2 year high on Friday, after positive press comment on yesterday's results showing a seven percent rise in pre-tax profit, traders said.</p>
<p>Shaking of yesterday's lacklustre reaction to the results, the stock was up 5p at 374-1/2 by 0903 GMT -- the highest since March 1993.</p>
</text>
